  <spoon:CtClass name="SteamBoilerController">
    <comment xsi:type="spoon:CtJavaDoc" commentContent="The steam-boiler control program's mode logic (SB-V1, SB-V2): one call of&#xA;{@link #step(InputEvent)} per cycle, after the receive stage. Every cycle&#xA;takes exactly one transition, and every transition sends MODE (SB-Beh24).&#xA;Within a mode the transitions are listed by precedence (SB-FR8): emergency&#xA;stop, then rescue, then degraded, then normal; each guard conjoins the&#xA;negations of the guards above it, so the guards of a mode are mutually&#xA;exclusive and together cover every case. The device commands of the cycle&#xA;(valve, pumps, PROGRAM_READY) are issued afterwards, from the mode decided&#xA;here, by {@link steam_boiler.actuator.DeviceCommands}."/>
    <modifier>PUBLIC</modifier>
    <modifier>FINAL</modifier>
